@startuml 07-security-audit-buyer-timeline
title Domain Story 7 — Security Audit versus Buyer Business Timeline
hide footbox
autonumber
participant "Business Source Context" as Source
participant "Business Traceability" as Traceability
participant Notifications
participant "Security Layer" as Security
actor "B2B Buyer" as Buyer

Source -> Traceability : Commit meaningful business fact
Traceability -> Traceability : Project reduced authorized Buyer timeline
Traceability -> Notifications : Publish notification projection input
Notifications --> Buyer : Send configured notification
Security -> Security : Record authorization/security audit fact separately
Traceability --> Buyer : Show authorized business progress and documents

note over Traceability,Security
Security audit details, worker notes and internal lot changes
are not Buyer timeline content. Traceability and Notifications remain separate BCs.
end note
@enduml
